<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Support cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Support cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it reduced the rating on Physician Support Systems Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 8-11/16 to 7-7/8.</p>
<p>-- co said Thursday that it expected to post revenues of $21 million for the fourth quarter and $74 million for the full year.</p>
<p>-- said net income for the quarter would be breakeven before merger costs and restructuring charges.</p>
</text>
